}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","type":"topic","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_PinchView/symbolEffect(_:options:isActive:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_PinchView\/symbolEffect(_:options:isActive:)","title":"symbolEffect(_:options:isActive:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinchview\/symboleffect(_:options:isactive:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"symbolEffect"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"options"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7Symbols19SymbolEffectOptionsV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SymbolEffectOptions"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isActive","kind":"externalParam"